<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cirrus Logic said upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cirrus Logic said upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette raised the rating on Cirrus Logic Inc to buy from market perform, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- raised the estimate to $1.70 per share from $1.50 for the 1998 year, ending in March, according to the source.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $25, the source said.</p>
</text>
